{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20029","headline":"严河南 · 孟郊","name":"严河南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赤令风骨峭，语言清霜寒。\n不必用雄威，见者毛发攒。\n我有赤令心，未得赤令官。\n终朝衡门下，忍志将筑弹。\n君从西省郎，正有东洛观。\n洛民萧条久，威恩悯抚难。\n苦竹声啸雪，夜斋闻千竿。\n诗人偶寄耳，听苦心多端。\n多端落杯酒，酒中方得欢。\n隐士多饮酒，此言信难刊。\n取次令坊沽，举止务在宽。\n何必红烛娇，始言清宴阑。\n丈夫莫矜庄，矜庄不中看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}